  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Euchre. 24-card partnership trick game. Trump chosen by ordering up or naming. Bowers: Right (trump Jack, highest) and Left (matching-color Jack, 2nd highest trump). Makers need 3/5 tricks. Euchre = opponents +2. Target: 10 points.',
    Player: 'The up-card is Qâ™¥. You hold Jâ™¥ (Right Bower), Jâ™¦ (Left Bower if Hearts trump), Aâ™¥, 9â™£, Kâ™¦. Order it up! You have Right Bower, Left Bower, and Ace of trump = virtually certain March (5 tricks). Go Alone for 4 points!',
    objective: 'Win at least 3 of 5 tricks with your partner; first team to 10 or 11 points wins the game.',
    gameplay: 'Players bid to make trump suit, then play tricks. The making team must win at least 3 tricks to score points. Special trump cards (bowers and aces) rank highest. Players can choose to play alone for higher scoring potential.',
    keyRules: [
      'Right Bower (trump Jack) is the HIGHEST trump card.',
      'Left Bower (matching-color Jack) is the SECOND highest trump card and IS trump suit (not its original suit).',
      'Being Euchred = losing team scores 2 points.',
      'Maker must win 3 of 5 tricks.',
